{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glow Up Salon Simulator</strong> isn\u2019t just about changing appearances \u2014 it\u2019s a lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It blends beauty, emotional wellness, and business management into a relaxing simulation. Guide your clients into themed rooms, meet their needs, automate operations, and grow your self-care empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome Clients, Hear Their Stories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each visitor arrives with a unique concern.<br>Send them to the right room \u2014 hair, nails, waxing, therapy, or personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/07b5fd8c1c617f6bb36c0e5128dd3c2c.poster.avif?t=1758649198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/07b5fd8c1c617f6bb36c0e5128dd3c2c.webm?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/07b5fd8c1c617f6bb36c0e5128dd3c2c.mp4?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze, Help, and Track Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify client needs, offer personalized services, and follow their evolution.<br>Higher satisfaction brings better reviews, and your salon grows through emotional and humorous stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/65b823149ddd4e0dbf2d5e11855bf1ca.poster.avif?t=1758649198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/65b823149ddd4e0dbf2d5e11855bf1ca.webm?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/65b823149ddd4e0dbf2d5e11855bf1ca.mp4?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go From Manual to Automated</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you do it all \u2014 answer calls, schedule appointments, assign rooms.<br>Eventually, unlock automation and let your systems handle check-ins while you focus on upgrades and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/94cf4cfca8018e50ceecaf042a468c2a.poster.avif?t=1758649198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/94cf4cfca8018e50ceecaf042a468c2a.webm?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/94cf4cfca8018e50ceecaf042a468c2a.mp4?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Upgrade Specialized Rooms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has its own visuals, sounds, and mechanics.<br>From reading nooks to therapy pods, invest wisely to meet physical, emotional, and mental needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/c39ca137d37ff1987c7188818314b041.poster.avif?t=1758649198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/c39ca137d37ff1987c7188818314b041.webm?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/c39ca137d37ff1987c7188818314b041.mp4?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prestige and Restart Stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your salon reaches peak performance, sell it to investors.<br>Start over with permanent upgrades and expand your reach into more advanced cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/6b4c7da924f9e549332ca25eefbae353.poster.avif?t=1758649198\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/6b4c7da924f9e549332ca25eefbae353.webm?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/extras/6b4c7da924f9e549332ca25eefbae353.mp4?t=1758649198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing, Story-Driven World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glow Up Salon Simulator</strong> offers cozy visuals, witty characters, and a calm gameplay loop.<br>Perfect for beauty fans, casual players, and anyone who loves meaningful management sims.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877390?t=1758649198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/e6dc2cbfe6fed8db340732f72b65f65f3c56e0a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758649198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/1bd1283f73f9919100f0d480d7cb6b8682fe7dd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758649198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877390/1bd1283f73f9919100f0d480d7cb6b8682fe7dd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758649198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes 